re this knockout also improves  the survival of these mice as shown here  in panel b  so you see here the blue line and the  knockout the mice live much longer  than in the control condition  in conclusion in this study lipidomics  was integral to elucidate  that the ethyl coa synthetase acsl3 and  the essel  transform transferase alpi  a regular cancer cell proliferation by  affecting prostaglandin synthesis  the authors speculate about targeting  this axis to selectively target  tumor-derived prostaglandin synthesis  as a potential treatment strategy and  the use of this axis is biomarker for  personalized anti-cancer treatment and  human lung tumors  in summary i have given you an  introduction to lipids  and epidemics and how lipidomics was  used to identify lipid biomarkers for  obesity  and to unravel disease mechanisms and  cancer if you're interested in further  details and would like to discuss  specific applications  please contact us at info lipotype.com  thank you for your attention and goodbye

